# Harvest

What came out of the beds this year, and how it keeps. Sown by the
[[Planting calendar]]; the ==tomatoes== did best, see [[Tomatoes#Varieties|the varieties]].

<Callout type="tip" title="Pick in the morning">
Leaves and pods are firmest before the sun is on them. #harvest
</Callout>

## Stores

<Tabs>
<Tab label="Roots">
Carrots and beetroot in damp sand, in the shed. They keep until March.
</Tab>
<Tab label="Fruit">
Green tomatoes ripen in a drawer with a banana. Check them every few days.
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<Details summary="Weights by bed">

| Bed | Crop     | Kilos |
| --- | -------- | ----: |
| 1   | Tomatoes |    14 |
| 2   | Beans    |     6 |

</Details>

